===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Expedition|Larvitar|116}} from the {{TCG|Expedition Base Set}}.
*'''Corkscrew Punch''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Vending|Machop|S2}} from {{TCG|Expansion Sheet 2}}.
